    <trans-unit id="flexform.maxItemsPerRow.help"><source>Applies to Patterned mosaic on wide screens. Responsive layouts automatically reduce density on smaller screens. This is a maximum target, not a guarantee that every visual row contains exactly this many items.</source><target>Primjenjuje se na modularni mozaik na širokim ekranima. Responzivni rasporedi automatski smanjuju gustoću na manjim ekranima. Ovo je maksimalni cilj, ne jamstvo točnog broja u svakom redu.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="flexform.maxWidth.help"><source>Maximum width of the processed image loaded into a gallery tile. This does not set the tile width and does not affect the Lightbox image, which opens the original file.</source><target>Maksimalna širina obrađene slike učitane u pločicu galerije. Ne postavlja širinu pločice i ne utječe na Lightbox sliku koja otvara izvornu datoteku.</target></trans-unit>
