    <trans-unit id="flexform.captions"><source>Quick captions (simple / legacy method)</source><target>Brzi natpisi (jednostavna / legacy metoda)</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="flexform.captions.help"><source>Enter one line per image in the current display order. This is convenient for a small gallery with a fixed file set and order, but captions are not attached to individual files. Adding or removing files, or using Random order, can move captions to different images. Use Image metadata for stable captions.</source><target>Unesite jedan red po slici u trenutačnom redoslijedu prikaza. Pogodno za malu galeriju s fiksnim skupom datoteka, ali natpisi nisu vezani uz pojedinačne datoteke. Dodavanje/uklanjanje datoteka ili slučajni redoslijed može premjestiti natpise. Koristite metapodatke slike za stabilne natpise.</target></trans-unit>
