    <trans-unit id="metadata.help.gallerySpecific"><source>Caption and alternative text entered here belong to this gallery and stay with the image when its order changes. Choose Inherit to use the existing fallback.</source><target>Natpis i alternativni tekst ovdje pripadaju ovoj galeriji i ostaju uz sliku kad se redoslijed promijeni. Odaberite Naslijedi za postojeću rezervu.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.help.filelist"><source>Reusable file metadata can be maintained under File → Filelist → Edit Metadata. Gallery-specific values are local to this gallery and can override that metadata.</source><target>Ponovno upotrebljivi metapodaci datoteka održavaju se u Datoteka → Filelist → Uredi metapodatke. Vrijednosti galerije su lokalne za ovu galeriju i mogu ih nadjačati.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.help.multilingual"><source>File metadata can be translated through the normal Filelist translation workflow. For gallery-specific text in another language, edit the translated Mosaic Gallery content element. Without an override, the current fallback behavior applies.</source><target>Metapodaci datoteka mogu se prevoditi normalnim Filelist procesom prijevoda. Za tekst galerije na drugom jeziku uredite prevedeni Mosaic Gallery content element. Bez nadjačavanja vrijedi trenutačno rezervno ponašanje.</target></trans-unit>
