    <trans-unit id="metadata.language.statusUnavailable"><source>Translation status is unavailable for this record&apos;s localization lineage. Manage translations through TYPO3&apos;s normal page translation workflow.</source><target>Status prijevoda nije dostupan za lokalizacijsku liniju ovog zapisa. Upravljajte prijevodima normalnim TYPO3 procesom prijevoda stranica.</target></trans-unit>
