    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.title"><source>Move Quick captions to Image metadata</source><target>Premjesti brze natpise u metapodatke slike</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.action"><source>Convert legacy captions to image metadata</source><target>Pretvori legacy natpise u metapodatke slike</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.guidance"><source>Copies the existing caption lines to the files they currently match and attaches them to those images. The original Quick captions text is retained. After conversion, Image metadata is authoritative and captions remain stable when files are reordered, added, or removed.</source><target>Kopira postojeće redove natpisa u datoteke kojima trenutačno odgovaraju i povezuje ih s tim slikama. Izvorni tekst brzih natpisa zadržava se. Nakon pretvorbe metapodaci slike su autoritativni i natpisi ostaju stabilni kad se datoteke preurede, dodaju ili uklone.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.randomBlocked"><source>Legacy captions cannot be converted while Random order is selected. Choose Filename or Modification time, save the gallery, then convert.</source><target>Legacy natpisi se ne mogu pretvoriti dok je odabran slučajni redoslijed. Odaberite Naziv datoteke ili Vrijeme izmjene, spremite galeriju i zatim pretvorite.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.complete"><source>Legacy captions have been converted. Image metadata is now used for stable file-linked captions. Quick captions are retained only as a legacy reference.</source><target>Legacy natpisi su pretvoreni. Metapodaci slike sada se koriste za stabilne natpise povezane s datotekama. Brzi natpisi ostaju samo kao legacy referenca.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.extraLines"><source>%d legacy caption line(s) had no current image match and remain in Quick captions.</source><target>%d redova legacy natpisa nije imalo trenutačno podudaranje slike i ostaje u brzim natpisima.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.multilingual"><source>Convert captions separately in each translated gallery.</source><target>Pretvorite natpise zasebno u svakoj prevedenoj galeriji.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.fileMetadataEnabled"><source>Quick captions are not currently used because file metadata fallback is enabled. To convert Quick captions, disable file metadata fallback, save the gallery, then convert.</source><target>Brzi natpisi se trenutačno ne koriste jer je rezerva metapodataka datoteke uključena. Za pretvorbu isključite rezervu, spremite galeriju i pretvorite.</target></trans-unit>
    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.savedSettings"><source>Conversion uses the last saved gallery settings. Save changes to sorting, Quick captions, or file metadata fallback before converting.</source><target>Pretvorba koristi zadnje spremljene postavke galerije. Spremite promjene sortiranja, brzih natpisa ili rezerve metapodataka prije pretvorbe.</target></trans-unit>
